### 1. Get Total Payments
GET http://localhost:4004/api/analytics/payments/count
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 2. Get Successful Payments
GET http://localhost:4002/api/analytics/payments/successful
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 3. Get Failed Payments
GET http://localhost:4004/api/analytics/payments/failed
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 4. Get Pending Payments
GET http://localhost:4004/api/analytics/payments/pending
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 4. Get Total Revenue
GET http://localhost:4004/api/analytics/payments/revenue
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 5. Get Payment Statistics
GET http://localhost:4004/api/analytics/payments/statistics
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}